{"version":1,"key":"card:429","content":{"id":429,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"米的定义的演变历史："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1795 年法国科学院对米进行了定义：赤道到北极点的海平面子午线的长度而定，一米为这个子午线长度的一千万分之一。但该种定义存在的问题是地球的并不是静止不动的，人为或者非人为的地貌改变都可能会改变测量的长度。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1960 年，第 11 届度量大会上重新定义了米重新定义了米：﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"^{86}\\text{Kr}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"86"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 原子的 2p10 和 5d5 能级之间跃迁所对应的辐射在真空中的波长的 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"1 650 763.73","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1 650 763.73"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 倍，其复现不确定度可以达到 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"2.7×10^{-8}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2.7×10-8"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"^{86}\\text{Kr}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"86"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 原子橙黄谱线具有最窄和最对称的辐射谱线，能在最小扰动下产生，并可用其他方法测量。这一单色光谱线的波长值只与其辐射频率和真空中的光速有关。如果光速为定值，则波长就是不随时间变化、可在任何时间、任何地点复现的值，适于作为新定义的自然量标准。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"1983 年，由于 ﻿"},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"^{86}\\text{Kr}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"86"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不易取得，且光速的测定也已非常精确，所以将米与光速进行挂钩，定义为真空中光在 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"\\dfrac{1}{299792458}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"\\dfrac{1}{299792458}"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 秒内传播的距离。这一定义利用了秒定义的高度准确性和固定的真空中光速值("},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"c = \\dfrac{λ}{f} = 299 792 458 \\, \\text{m/s}","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"c=λ/f=299 792 458 m/s"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":")，使得长度计量基准的准确度进一步提高。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《这才是最好读的数学史》，P118-P120"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.baike.com/wikiid/7207661612277268514","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抖音百科-米"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"link","url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/508895412","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"度量衡--米和千克定义的发展历史"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]}],"tags":["杂/米"],"createTime":1715415187335,"updateTime":1744070033089,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744070033089}}